ledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[37,39],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[38,39],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[40,42],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[41,42],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[43,44]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/Q7ADB7DS","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/7ZKK4GVB?page=1&annotation=INM2RHUR","line":35},{"title":"Sayfa 5","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/7ZKK4GVB?page=5&annotation=3UAGV47N","line":38},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/7ZKK4GVB?page=1&annotation=72YXN6RG","line":41}],"metadata":{"Title":"DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease","Authors":"Huai-Yu Wang, Chi Yuan, Yi-Heng Zhao, Yan Yi, Yi-Nuo Chen, Yelin Li, Dongyuan Chang, Xiaomeng Lin, Ji Wang, Sydney Chi Wai Tang, Qi Wang, Min Chen","Year":2025,"DOI":"10.1186/s12967-025-07178-8","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"To evaluate the DHerbKB, CKD cases with different complications were designed, and full-day dietary schedules covering 136 foods/cuisines were extracted from guidelines/literatures.","Findings":"By integrating multiple guidelines, individualized recommendations were manually extracted and structured on the intake of protein, energy, sodium, potassium, and phosphorus for CKD management","Conclusions":"The DHerbKB integrated and transformed the knowledge and data of CKD dietary management and toxic Chinese herbal medicines control into an easy-to-use and reliable system. Resource covered by the DHerbKB are opened for future researches regarding CKD care, toxic herbs control and related artificial intelligence.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"böbrek has için çok iyi bir veritabanı olmuş table derste kullanılabilir.  ama ai destekli mi anlamadım, dığrula"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1k5vq0t","at":1774939558283}},"smart_blocks:Augmented Dietitian Okunmuşlar/wangDHerbKBCKDKnowledge2025.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.10073268,-0.00719397,0.0294489,-0.02965146,-0.00989237,-0.06314451,0.02433709,0.03756819,-0.03680784,0.02347816,-0.01589055,-0.10523374,0.02021318,0.04866729,0.03982585,0.00817037,0.06521286,0.01334177,-0.03818891,0.0041385,0.09018217,-0.050881,0.01692384,0.00094868,0.01807082,0.0104518,0.03720675,-0.0223557,-0.0120922,-0.19517407,0.03433473,-0.01377692,0.06506613,-0.04189848,-0.04843854,-0.02614653,-0.00794098,0.06298285,-0.04559085,-0.00373486,0.07695765,0.04147679,0.04386836,0.01356014,-0.01713566,-0.05043133,-0.05589468,-0.00527771,0.00151772,0.00376827,-0.0336462,-0.01733259,0.05801773,0.03021624,0.07629646,-0.01965932,0.04482692,0.02915109,0.05309929,0.12218831,0.04296623,0.04416838,-0.21135509,0.10562705,-0.0441009,0.03888133,-0.05060385,0.04650594,0.05047684,-0.03113416,-0.03387876,-0.0096518,0.02874043,0.02892832,-0.01264647,-0.01957263,0.01438634,-0.01627108,-0.0601666,0.01595909,-0.02782454,0.10724928,0.01951943,-0.04621447,-0.0311364,-0.02337331,-0.01739563,-0.03799226,0.01604669,0.0033351,0.00237599,-0.00940266,0.03013697,-0.00578319,-0.03849926,-0.02116904,0.01076989,-0.04090477,-0.08335397,0.10576845,-0.0643643,0.00947346,-0.02825613,-0.01869156,0.03444462,-0.0338629,-0.05208612,-0.02814679,-0.00601599,0.018